    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WF-03 · Call Result Polling & AI Classification\n\n**Credentials needed:**\n- Get Execution (Bolna node): your 'Rudvaya Bolna API' credential (same one used in WF-02)\n- Load Facts + Model (Postgres), Save Result (Postgres), Mark No Answer (Postgres), Load For No-Answer (Postgres), Act nodes (Postgres) — all your Supabase Postgres credential\n- Classify Call (HTTP Request to OpenAI): Predefined Credential Type = OpenAi, your OpenAI credential\n\n**Verified against the installed n8n-nodes-bolna v0.1.2 package and Bolna's public API reference (confirmed, not guessed):**\n- Endpoint: GET https://api.bolna.ai/executions/{execution_id} — the 'Get Execution' node below uses the Bolna community node itself (resource=call, operation=get), not a raw HTTP Request, so this path is handled by the node automatically.\n- Auth: Authorization: Bearer <apiKey>, handled by the Bolna API credential — confirmed from BolnaApi.credentials.js.\n- CALL_STATUSES (from BolnaTrigger.node.js): scheduled, queued, rescheduled, initiated, ringing, in-progress, call-disconnected, completed, balance-low, busy, no-answer, canceled, failed, stopped, error. 'Check Finished' treats the first 6 as in-flight and everything else as terminal.\n- Response fields (confirmed from Bolna's live API docs): status, transcript, summary, conversation_duration, telephony_data.duration, telephony_data.recording_url.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 520
      },
